BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 699 Td (Analysis of 48 months of transactional data reveals pronounced recurring fourth-quarter \(Q4\) seasonality:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 686 Td (- Peak Performance: November 2018 recorded the highest monthly sales in company history at $117,938.15,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 673 Td (  followed by December 2017 \($95,739.12\) and September 2018 \($86,152.89\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 660 Td (- Holiday / Fiscal Year-End Surge: Q4 consistently generates ~35% of annual revenue due to holiday retail) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 647 Td (  demand and enterprise client annual budget clearance cycles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 634 Td (- Trough Periods: January and February consistently exhibit the lowest monthly volumes \($18k-$28k range\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 621 Td (  due to post-holiday consumer fatigue and annual corporate procurement freezes.) Tj ET
